(6695182, 1000326, 63244, '<td valign="top">Loved, loved, loved this shot and am thrilled to see this win the blue! Congrats!<br/> <br/>I''m a HUGE Degas fan and your photo immediately made me think of his body of work! Brilliant!!!! Gonna have to fave...better late than never!</td>', 'Loved, loved, loved this shot and am thrilled to see this win the blue! Congrats! I''m a HUGE Degas fan and your photo immediately made me think of his body of work! Brilliant!!!! Gonna have to fave...better late than never!', '2012-02-29 11:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
