(6695191, 999822, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice to see who the shooter was on this shot. I was tempted to ask for validation, but I didn''t. I thought the flip flop might have been a separate photo and cloned into the shot as a layer. I thought this due to the processing. It was the highlights on the person''s arms and legs and the shadow cast by the shoe that made me think the light was a little different on each item. I ended up voting a 7!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-29 11:57:06.</i></td>', 'Nice to see who the shooter was on this shot. I was tempted to ask for validation, but I didn''t. I thought the flip flop might have been a separate photo and cloned into the shot as a layer. I thought this due to the processing. It was the highlights on the person''s arms and legs and the shadow cast by the shoe that made me think the light was a little different on each item. I ended up voting a 7!', '2012-02-29 11:56:34.000000', '2012-02-29 11:57:06.000000', 0),
