(6696909, 999822, 69684, '<td valign="top">So you get your models from DPC :)  To be honest, I didn''t liked the colors here (but sometimes nature produce some strange things).</td>', 'So you get your models from DPC :)  To be honest, I didn''t liked the colors here (but sometimes nature produce some strange things).', '2012-03-01 14:50:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6696910, 999432, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me it''s always about the story.  I may not like the story, but if it tells a story, to me it''s a good image.  This image has too many conflicting elements that the story is murky.  What are you trying to tell us?  If it''s of all the blood and sweat and sacrifice, this image is too clean. If it''s about military, it''s too "posed" and fashiony. If it''s about style, it''s not "pretty" enough.  If it''s "freedom", it''s too constricted.  Etc., etc.  Technically, this is a decent enough image, but it doesn''t tell me anything.</td>', 'For me it''s always about the story.  I may not like the story, but if it tells a story, to me it''s a good image.  This image has too many conflicting elements that the story is murky.  What are you trying to tell us?  If it''s of all the blood and sweat and sacrifice, this image is too clean. If it''s about military, it''s too "posed" and fashiony. If it''s about style, it''s not "pretty" enough.  If it''s "freedom", it''s too constricted.  Etc., etc.  Technically, this is a decent enough image, but it doesn''t tell me anything.', '2012-03-01 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
