(6697677, 999432, 30982, '<td valign="top">I guess my first impression is the image is rather pink!  Without the dogtags, I would not think of military footwear with these - probably due to the toning.  Still, you have a good grasp of the basics!<br/> <br/>And just for fun - these are my boots:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=561720" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_561720.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_561720.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_561720.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I guess my first impression is the image is rather pink!  Without the dogtags, I would not think of military footwear with these - probably due to the toning.  Still, you have a good grasp of the basics! And just for fun - these are my boots: ', '2012-03-02 02:15:43.000000', NULL, 0),
